               Security Alert: External Transfer\n                                    </p>\n                                    <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-red-100 text-red-700 text-[9px] font-black uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-4-2-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"urgent badge\">\n                                        Urgent\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-[#111111]/40 font-mono uppercase font-bold tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-4-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"message timestamp\">\n                                    2026-07-30 12:44\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-[#111111]/70 leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-4-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"message body text\">\n                                System log confirmed a transfer of\n                                <span class=\"font-bold text-[#111111]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-4-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"transfer amount\">\n                                    $1,200.00\n                                </span>\n                                was successfully processed to external account ending in **4492. Verification process completed at 12:44:02 UTC. If this wasn't you, please contact support immediately for immediate freeze.\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-4 pt-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-4-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"message actions container\">\n                                <button class=\"text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#1560BD] hover:underline cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-4-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"open report button\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-external-link\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-4-2-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"external link icon\">\n                                    </i>\n                                   